Copy the DRM-free GOG version of Jump King, version 1.06, into this folder:
your copy must contain JumpKing.exe and the Content/ folder (the whole GOG game
folder contents). Steam copies are not supported.

Use a spare copy of your GOG folder, not your only one: the first launch
converts the textures in Content/ to ASTC in place. Saves are stored under
Content/ in this folder and are preserved on later launches.
